Third-party data redistributed in this repository remains under its own terms:

  * The EnergyPlus TMY3 weather file for San Francisco Intl. (WMO 724940) is
    redistributed under the EnergyPlus weather-data terms.
  * Vehicle-travel statistics are derived from the 2017 U.S. National Household
    Travel Survey (NHTS), a public-domain dataset of the Federal Highway
    Administration, U.S. Department of Transportation.
  * Tariff parameters are taken from published Pacific Gas and Electric Company
    schedules (E-TOU-C, B-19) and the California Public Utilities Commission
    Net Billing Tariff decision D.22-12-056.
